---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Nipponexus" description="How Nipponexus handles personal information, cookies, advertising and contact form submissions." locale="en" altLang="https://nipponexus.com/privacy/">
  <section class="index-hero"><div class="hero-content"><h1 class="hero-title">Privacy Policy</h1></div></section>
  <article class="container-narrow article-body">
    <p>Nipponexus (the "Site") is a website operated by a sole proprietorship, providing information on Japanese festivals and annual events. This policy explains how personal information is handled on the Site.</p>
    <h2>1. Operator</h2>
    <p>Nexus Data Studio (sole proprietorship)<br />Address: Shinjuku Dai-7 Hayama Bldg. 3F, 1-36-2 Shinjuku, Shinjuku-ku, Tokyo 160-0022, Japan<br />Contact: info@nipponexus.com</p>
    <h2>2. Information collected and purpose of use</h2>
    <p>When you submit the "Report incorrect info" form on any page, we receive your email address (optional), the content of your report, and the URL of the page concerned. This information is used solely to verify and correct article content and, where necessary, to reply to you. Providing an email address is optional; reports can be submitted without one.</p>
    <h2>3. Disclosure to third parties and external services</h2>
    <p>We do not disclose collected information to third parties without your consent. However, the report form is processed through the external service Web3Forms, and submissions reach the operator via that service. The provider's own privacy policy applies to its handling of data. Disclosure may also occur where required by law.</p>
    <h2>4. Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>The Site may use cookies to understand usage and improve content. Cookies are small text files and do not by themselves identify you personally. You may refuse cookies through your browser settings, although some features may then be unavailable.</p>
    <h2>5. Advertising</h2>
    <p>The Site may display advertisements served by third parties. Such providers may use cookies to show ads based on your interests. Please refer to each provider's settings page for information on disabling cookies or personalised advertising.</p>
    <h2>6. Nature of published information</h2>
    <p>Articles are compiled from publicly available information published by municipalities and organisers, and from Wikidata and Wikipedia (CC BY-SA). Dates, fees and access details are subject to change, so please confirm official announcements before visiting. If you find an error, please use the report form on the relevant page.</p>
    <h2>7. Requests for disclosure, correction or deletion</h2>
    <p>To request disclosure, correction or deletion of information relating to you, please contact info@nipponexus.com. We will respond promptly after verifying your identity.</p>
    <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>This policy may be revised as necessary. Revisions take effect when published on this page.</p>
    <p style="opacity:0.7;font-size:0.9rem;">Established: 5 August 2026</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
